# Official Arch Linux packages, hand-curated. This file (plus aur.package,
# packages/hardware/*.package and packages/custom.package) is the single
# source of truth for what gets installed — nothing here is auto-synced from
# the running system. GPU drivers and CPU microcode are hardware-specific and
# live in packages/hardware/*.package instead (see lib/hardware-packages.sh).

